' Question: how does an exchange event reach the one bot it concerns, and where is the result kept?
' Explained by: ../05-building-blocks.md. Drawn by hand, high level.
@startuml 05-event-path
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
[trading, market_data\n(events on the bus)] as EV
[BotEventRouter] as RT
[GridFacts\n(on the bot's worker)] as F
[BotRunState\n(the one writer)] as S
[NotifyingBotStore] as N
[JsonBotStore] as J
EV --> RT : fill, end, tick, switch, ...
RT --> F : the executor that owns\nthe client order id
F --> S : transition, update
S --> N : IBotStore.save
N --> J : IBotStore.save
note bottom of N : publishes BotChangedEvent\nafter every save
@enduml
